  "lineage": "Balinese dance-opera in which the characters sing their roles, developed from gambuh and sung tembang poetry and performed in Balinese with Kawi passages, dramatising Panji and other romances. Its light gamelan geguntangan is built around suling flutes (here the generic bamboo-flute card), small kendang, ceng-ceng, a small timekeeping gong (the kempli card) and guntang bamboo tube zithers that mark the gong cycle (no card).",
